sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CD as Claude Desktop
    participant MCP as MCP Server<br/>(server.py · stdio)
    participant ST as SentenceTransformer<br/>(all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
    participant CDB as ChromaDB<br/>(local disk)

    U->>CD: "How do I roll back a bad deploy?"

    Note over CD,MCP: MCP tool-use — JSON-RPC over stdio
    CD->>MCP: tools/call → search_docs("how do I roll back a bad deploy?")

    MCP->>ST: encode(query_text) — offline inference
    ST-->>MCP: float32[384] query embedding

    MCP->>CDB: collection.query(query_embedding, n_results=5)
    Note over CDB: Cosine similarity via inner product<br/>(vectors are L2-normalized)
    CDB-->>MCP: top-5 chunks + metadata<br/>[{text, source, start_line, end_line, score}, ...]

    MCP-->>CD: JSON result with chunks + citations<br/>[source: deployment-runbook.md:L8-L14]

    CD->>CD: Inject retrieved chunks into context window
    CD->>U: Answer grounded in actual doc content<br/>with verifiable line-number citation
